From 923238fedac7ec031ec1e40efcb1d27d51b61c93 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dario Gabriel Lipicar <dario@status.im>
Date: Thu, 26 Nov 2026 18:04:23 -0300
Subject: [PATCH 3/5] feat(sync): widen the scripts in place

UpdateSubscriber::widen_handle() takes the last index to watch per
keychain, applied before the next event: the index derives the scripts
through it and the filters are checked against them from then on. That
covers addresses the wallet revealed since the node was built, a window
wider than the wallet's lookahead, and with Requester::rescan_from the
running node scans again without a new node and without downloading
headers again.
